{"asset_key":"mn2/env_story_10370060","episode":"mn2","category":"env_story","story_id":"10370060","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1037006001:1":{"text":"아직까진 괜찮아요.","source_cn":"目前一切尚好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCB7D58224BC3535","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1037006002:1":{"text":"폭주하는 몬스터들이 마을에서 꽤 떨어져 있거든요.","source_cn":"那些发狂怪物目前距离村子还有一定距离。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF4A204BF9B8FAD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1037006003:1":{"text":"메트졸과 전 걱정이 돼서 자발적으로 이곳을 지키겠다고 나선 거고요.","source_cn":"美特苏尔和我有些担心，所以主动提出来守卫这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F17995F58BD0D32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1037006004:1":{"text":"우리가 이 길목을 지키는 한, 몬스터가 우리 마을을 습격하는 일은 없을 거예요!","source_cn":"只要我们守住这条路，怪物就不能袭击我们的村子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A459A9153CAFD83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:守卫契尔忒":{"text":"체르테","source":"守卫契尔忒","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}